translate italian suzy3_60b55006:

    # "She turns and walks out, through my bedroom, out the hall, and then I hear her going down the stairs."
    "Si gira e se ne va, attraversa la mia camera da letto, esce in corridoio, e poi la sento scendere le scale."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/Suzy3.rpy:73
